@startuml
title MANTA — Whale Estimator Initialization

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false

start
:Trailing mission starts one whale_estimator_node per vehicle;
:Load ros/whale_estimator/config.yaml and vehicle_id;
:Call whale_estimator_init(state);
:Clear state, including filter axes, recent fixes,
received fix, prediction, and validity flags;
:Set defaults in state.config:
recent-fix window age and process-noise strength;
:Set velocity return time and nominal velocity
(1.5 m/s north, 0 m/s east);
:Set initial velocity variance;
:Set configured_b = true;
:Copy and validate ROS tuning parameters into state.config;
:Subscribe to vehicle position fixes;
:Publish vehicle filter estimates;
stop

@enduml
